{"unit_id":"huabai-flowerwhite__dsh-plugin-manager#card-zh","repo":"huabai-flowerwhite/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"354d9d489b69bdbc53b5342c72de701b50aabe1b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh plugin manager 是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 第三方插件管理器，在设置页提供插件库选择、扫描、状态查看和启停操作。它由 host composition 加载，通过 webServer 路由扫描插件目录、读取启停状态，并修改 cordis.patch.yml 中的 disabled 标记；客户端设置面板展示插件列表并调用这些路由。适合需要集中查看和管理已部署 DSH 插件的用户。启停变更在重启 DSH 后生效，运行时需要访问本机 DSH profiles 目录，不需要 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:231-331","src/client.js:139-180","cordis.patch.yml:1-10"]}
{"unit_id":"huabai-flowerwhite__dsh-plugin-manager#card-en","repo":"huabai-flowerwhite/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"354d9d489b69bdbc53b5342c72de701b50aabe1b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh plugin manager adds a plugin panel to DSH Web settings. Choose and scan a folder, view plugin states, and toggle plugins; host routes update cordis.patch.yml. Changes take effect after restarting DSH. It needs local access to DSH profiles and no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:231-331","src/client.js:139-180","cordis.patch.yml:1-10"]}
